{"index": 9, "skill": "water-situation", "level": "L2", "question": "查询里运河（河流）最近两个月的水位数据。", "expected_sql": "SELECT b.stnm AS '测站名称',\n       ROUND(AVG(r.z), 2) AS '平均水位(m)',\n       ROUND(MAX(r.z), 2) AS '最高水位(m)',\n       ROUND(MIN(r.z), 2) AS '最低水位(m)'\nFROM sl323.st_river_r r\nJOIN sl323.st_stbprp_b b ON r.stcd = b.stcd\nWHERE b.rvnm = '里运河'\n  AND r.tm >= DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL 2 MONTH)\n  AND r.z IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY b.stnm\nORDER BY b.stnm;", "final_answer": "瓜洲闸在最近两个月没有水位数据。现在查询已完成，以下是完整结果：\n\n---\n\n## 里运河（人工运河）水位数据 — 最近两个月\n\n**数据截止：** 2026-07-31\n**高程基准：** 废黄河口\n\n共找到 **5 个测站**，其中 4 个有水位数据（瓜洲闸无数据）。\n\n### 各测站统计汇总\n\n| 测站 | 监测天数 | 平均水位(m) | 最高水位(m) | 最高日期 | 最低水位(m) | 最低日期 | 水位波动(m) |\n|------|---------|------------|------------|---------|------------|---------|------------|\n| **泾河** | 62 | 5.72 | 6.83 | 2026-06-03 | 1.36 | 2026-06-01 | 5.47 |\n| **宝应** | 62 | 2.85 | 6.61 | 2026-06-01 | 1.16 | 2026-06-05 | 5.45 |\n| **高邮(大)** | 62 | 5.77 | 7.02 | 2026-06-04 | 2.07 | 2026-06-01 | 4.95 |\n| **邵伯(大)** | 62 | 5.33 | 6.85 | 2026-06-03 | 1.24 | 2026-06-07 | 5.61 |\n\n### 分月趋势\n\n| 测站 | 月份 | 平均水位(m) | 最高水位(m) | 最低水位(m) |\n|------|------|------------|------------|------------|\n| 泾河 | 2026-06 | 5.46 | 6.83 | 1.36 |\n| 泾河 | 2026-07 | 5.99 | 6.14 | 5.80 |\n| 宝应 | 2026-06 | 3.09 | 6.61 | 1.16 |\n| 宝应 | 2026-07 | 2.59 | 2.66 | 2.51 |\n| 高邮(大) | 2026-06 | 5.64 | 7.02 | 2.07 |\n| 高邮(大) | 2026-07 | 5.86 | 6.03 | 5.69 |\n| 邵伯(大) | 2026-06 | 5.11 | 6.85 | 1.24 |\n| 邵伯(大) | 2026-07 | 5.60 | 5.77 | 5.46 |\n\n### 关键发现\n\n1. **6月初水位波动剧烈**：各测站在6月1日—7日期间出现极低水位（宝应最低1.16m，泾河1.36m），同时伴随高峰（宝应6.61m，高邮7.02m），水位波动幅度达5m以上，可能与闸泵调度或降雨事件有关。\n2. **7月水位趋于平稳**：进入7月后各站水位波动明显收窄，日变化基本在0.2—0.3m以内，整体水位较6月有所回升。\n3. **宝应站水位偏低**：宝应站平均水位仅2.85m，显著低于其他站点，7月稳定在2.5—2.7m区间。\n4. **瓜洲闸无数据**：该站最近两个月无水位监测记录。\n\n> **数据局限性说明：** 本库里运河覆盖4个有效测站，均为废黄河口高程基准，可直接对比。各站日观测次数为1次/天，数据较为稳定。", "actual_sqls": ["SELECT DISTINCT b.stcd, b.stnm, b.rvnm, b.hnnm, b.sttp, b.dtmnm\n    FROM st_stbprp_b b\n    WHERE b.stnm LIKE '%里运河%' OR b.rvnm LIKE '%里运河%'\n    ORDER BY b.stnm", "SELECT MAX(tm) as max_tm FROM st_river_r\n    WHERE stcd IN ('{stcds_str}')", "SELECT\n        r.stcd,\n        DATE(r.tm) AS dt,\n        ROUND(AVG(r.z), 2) AS avg_z,\n        ROUND(MIN(r.z), 2) AS min_z,\n        ROUND(MAX(r.z), 2) AS max_z,\n        COUNT(*) AS obs_cnt\n    FROM st_river_r r\n    WHERE r.stcd IN ('{stcds_str}')\n      AND r.tm >= DATE_SUB('{max_tm}', INTERVAL 2 MONTH)\n      AND r.z IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY r.stcd, DATE(r.tm)\n    ORDER BY r.stcd, dt", "SELECT DISTINCT b.stcd, b.stnm, b.rvnm, b.hnnm, b.sttp, b.dtmnm\n    FROM st_stbprp_b b\n    WHERE b.stnm LIKE '%里运河%' OR b.rvnm LIKE '%里运河%'\n    ORDER BY b.stnm", "SELECT MAX(tm) as max_tm FROM st_river_r\n    WHERE stcd IN ('{stcds_str}')", "SELECT\n        r.stcd,\n        DATE(r.tm) AS dt,\n        ROUND(AVG(r.z), 2) AS avg_z,\n        ROUND(MIN(r.z), 2) AS min_z,\n        ROUND(MAX(r.z), 2) AS max_z,\n        COUNT(*) AS obs_cnt\n    FROM st_river_r r\n    WHERE r.stcd IN ('{stcds_str}')\n      AND r.tm >= DATE_SUB('{max_tm}', INTERVAL 2 MONTH)\n      AND r.z IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY r.stcd, DATE(r.tm)\n    ORDER BY r.stcd, dt", "SELECT\n        r.stcd,\n        YEAR(r.tm) AS yr,\n        MONTH(r.tm) AS mn,\n        ROUND(AVG(r.z), 2) AS avg_z,\n        ROUND(MAX(r.z), 2) AS max_z,\n        ROUND(MIN(r.z), 2) AS min_z,\n        COUNT(*) AS obs_cnt\n    FROM st_river_r r\n    WHERE r.stcd IN ('{stcds_str}')\n      AND r.tm >= DATE_SUB('{max_tm}', INTERVAL 2 MONTH)\n      AND r.z IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY r.stcd, YEAR(r.tm), MONTH(r.tm)\n    ORDER BY r.stcd, yr, mn", "SELECT DISTINCT b.stcd, b.stnm, b.rvnm, b.hnnm, b.sttp, b.dtmnm\n    FROM st_stbprp_b b\n    WHERE b.stnm LIKE '%里运河%' OR b.rvnm LIKE '%里运河%'\n    ORDER BY b.stnm", "SELECT MAX(tm) as max_tm FROM st_river_r\n    WHERE stcd IN ('{stcds_str}')", "SELECT\n        r.stcd,\n        DATE(r.tm) AS dt,\n        ROUND(AVG(r.z), 2) AS avg_z,\n        ROUND(MIN(r.z), 2) AS min_z,\n     